name: agent
description: "The sub-agents a doer may call: each call starts a child run inside the runner, on the task's own stream and under its policy, with no record of its own."
verbs:
- name: call-sub-agent
  description: "Call a sub-agent by name: a child run inside the runner, on this task's stream, under its policy."
  fields:
  - {name: agent, form: text, description: "the sub-agent called"}
